  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From Seed to Sustainability - Food Systems 4 All</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project  objective is to accelerate the achievement of Sustainable Development Goals through supporting the implementation of the National Food System Pathways in Serbia further. Planned project activities will be focused on reviving the coordination mechanisms, strengthening institutional frameworks, boosting awareness and engagement of local actors, as well as piloting innovative and practical solutions around the food systems transition.</narrative>
